ions deviates the minds of these nutbars (see Iiznutz.com for expo/ref.)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5368684571678465328/comments/default/2613362750304099120'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5368684571678465328/comments/default/2613362750304099120'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/dont-ask-dont-tell-dont-think-things.html?showComment=1265814839420#c2613362750304099120' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/dont-ask-dont-tell-dont-think-things.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5368684571678465328' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5368684571678465328' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1163694182"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 10, 2010 at 8:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7950136341831122564</id><published>2010-02-10T07:16:36.927-07:00</published><updated>2010-02-10T07:16:36.927-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Edwin Vieira has done well with the organized stat...</title><content type='html'>Edwin Vieira has done well with the organized state militia topic, but beware of his other so-called &lt;br /&gt;constitutional views as he advocates Lincoln&amp;#39;s view that the sovereign states which created the federal government via a coup d&amp;#39; etat has no right to secede! Oh, yeah?! Then what was the War of Independence all about if not secession?!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5